        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, natural gas, at boiler condensing modulating &gt;100kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, natural gas, at boiler condensing modulating &gt;100kW
na;
Synonyms: Brennwerttechnik; 
UUID: 042b6bd1-3e1c-3227-a7c2-74d1b491348b
The module calls the module "natural gas, burned in boiler condensing modulating &gt;100kW" which in turn includes fuel input from high pressure (RER) network, infrastructure (boiler), emissions, and electricity needed for operation. The module uses the average net efficiency for the type of boiler (estimated from literature). The heat distribution is not included.; Geography: Extrapolation from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Location:  Extrapolation from Switzerland to Europe (RER).
Technology: New models on market
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_042b6bd1-3e1c-3227-a7c2-74d1b491348b.xml</text>
